ATCO Ventures - Partner Community
Description

Implement a Partner Community
a. A new partner community site will be established, along with appropriate profile, permissions and sharing rules.
b. The ATCO Ventures team will be able to onboard new partners as they are established, as well as deactivate users that are no longer partners.
c. Authorized partner users will be able to create new leads (deal registration via global quick action), and view existing leads shared with them.
d. Partners will collaborate on same record type as ATCO Ventures; but the Leads and Opportunities will be flagged to reflect Partner collaboration for ease of reporting.
i. Layouts and field level security will be used to ensure Partners are able to view or edit only the specified attributes that are needed..
ii. Leads created by Partners will be assigned to a queue for the ATCO Ventures team to pick up and work on.
iii. When a lead is converted into an Opportunity, the Partner that submitted the deal will be added to the Opportunity Team automatically. ATCO Ventures will be able to add/remove both internal and external resources to the Opportunity Team.
e. The portal will support authorized users to collaborate on deals where they are an identified team member. Users will only be able to edit certain fields and not others.
i. Create an Opportunity page layout for ATCO Ventures Partners and display lists of Opportunities that Partners are privy to in the portal.

