ATCO Ventures - Partner Community Access for Sales Collaboration

Description
Set up the Partner Community so ATCO Ventures and partners can collaborate on sales opportunities and related customer information.

Narrative
As an 
ATCO Ventures external partner or consultant 
I want to 

secure access to the partner experience
submit a prospective deal
continue collaborating when my submitted Lead becomes an Opportunity

So that
I can collaborate on permitted deals while maintaining integrity of the deal.
the internal sales team can review and progress partner-generated opportunities.
I can remain involved in the deal where authorized.

Acceptance Criteria
An approved Partner Community/Experience site will be configured.
Partner users will receive only the approved profile/Roles, permission set and sharing access.
Authorized internal users will be able to support onboarding and deactivation of partner users according to the approved operating process.
Partner access will not grant visibility to unrelated confidential deals.
When a partner-submitted Lead is converted, the originating Partner will be added to the Opportunity Team according to the approved design.
   The Opportunity will be identifiable as involving Partner collaboration.
   The Partner will only be able to access Opportunities where access has been explicitly granted through the approved model.
   Internal authorized users will be able to add or remove internal and external Opportunity Team members.

 
Technical Solution Details
Partner licensing is a dependency for production rollout.
Partner page layout and field permissions will restrict view/edit access to approved attributes.
